            {"op": "add", "key": "m2", "content": "阿桥夸我搭桥时耐心，觉得我很适合教新手", "type": "观点", "speaker": "aqiao", "stance": "观点", "about": ["self"], "belief": 95, "importance": 60, "pinned": false, "event_time": "2026-11-02T19:15:00+08:00", "sources": [{"entry_id": "group-build", "sender": "aqiao", "kind": "message", "at": "2026-11-02T19:15:00+08:00", "text": "Iris 好耐心，肯定适合教新手。"}, {"entry_id": "group-build", "sender": "self", "kind": "self_output", "at": "2026-11-02T19:16:00+08:00", "text": "谢谢你夸我。不过只搭了这一回，还不能说我就适合教人。"}]},
